  <h1>Projects</h1>

  <h2>FPL Pulse</h2>
  <p class="muted">Weekly LLM enrichment pipeline + agentic recommendation engine. AWS Lambda, Step Functions, Anthropic Claude, LangGraph, pgvector.</p>
  <p>
    End-to-end FPL analytics platform. Data collection from FPL API, Understat,
    and news sources lands in an S3 lake; weekly Step Function batch enriches
    players with LLM-generated summaries, injury context, and sentiment via
    Anthropic Haiku/Sonnet. A LangGraph agent (planner - tool_executor -
    reflector - recommender) sits over a pgvector store and streams transfer
    recommendations to the dashboard via a Lambda Function URL.
  </p>
  <p>
    Cost-engineered to sit within AWS free tier; the Claude API is the only
    meaningful spend.
  </p>
